==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɒpɪk}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# of, relating to, obtained with, or observable using a [[telescope]]
# [[capable]] of [[seeing]] [[distant]] [[object]]s
# capable of being [[extended]] or [[compressed]] by the use of [[part]]s that [[slide]] over one another
# Seen or discoverable only by means of a telescope.
#: '''''telescopic''' stars''

